{"seq":3,"slug":"eslint-config-design","title":"ESLint 配置体系设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/eslint-in-depth/eslint-config-design","wordCount":885,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"eslint-配置体系设计\">ESLint 配置体系设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ESLint 的配置体系是连接规则能力与项目需求的桥梁。一个设计良好的 ESLint 配置能够在<strong>严格性与开发体验</strong>之间取得平衡——既能捕获真正的代码问题，又不会产生大量噪音。ESLint 9.x 引入的 Flat Config 是配置体系的重大革新，它用简洁的 JavaScript 数组替代了复杂的级联配置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[项目需求分析] --&gt; B[选择基础配置集]&#10;    B --&gt; C[选择插件与规则]&#10;    C --&gt; D[配置规则严格度]&#10;    D --&gt; E[设置文件范围与覆盖]&#10;    E --&gt; F[处理特殊文件类型]&#10;    F --&gt; G[测试与迭代]\">flowchart TD\n    A[项目需求分析] --&gt; B[选择基础配置集]\n    B --&gt; C[选择插件与规则]\n    C --&gt; D[配置规则严格度]\n    D --&gt; E[设置文件范围与覆盖]\n    E --&gt; F[处理特殊文件类型]\n    F --&gt; G[测试与迭代]</pre><p>不同配置策略的适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>规则数量</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>适合团队</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从零开始</td>\n<td>高度定制化项目</td>\n<td>按需选择</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>有专职工具链工程师</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>继承推荐配置</td>\n<td>多数项目</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大多数团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严格 preset</td>\n<td>追求高代码质量</td>\n<td>大量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>成熟团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小配置</td>\n<td>快速原型、小项目</td>\n<td>极少</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>个人项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"规则严格度分级\">规则严格度分级</h2><p>ESLint 规则的配置值有三个级别：<code>&quot;off&quot;</code>（0）、<code>&quot;warn&quot;</code>（1）、<code>&quot;error&quot;</code>（2）。合理的分级策略直接影响开发体验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const severityStrategy = {&#10;  error: [&#39;no-undef&#39;, &#39;no-unused-vars&#39;, &#39;no-duplicate-imports&#39;, &#39;no-unreachable&#39;, &#39;no-use-before-define&#39;],&#10;  warn: [&#39;prefer-const&#39;, &#39;no-console&#39;, &#39;no-debugger&#39;, &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any&#39;],&#10;  off: [&#39;semi&#39;, &#39;indent&#39;, &#39;quotes&#39;, &#39;comma-dangle&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> severityStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  error: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-undef'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-unused-vars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-duplicate-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-unreachable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-use-before-define'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warn: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prefer-const'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-console'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no-debugger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  off: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'semi'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'indent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quotes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'comma-dangle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分级的核心原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用规则类型</th>\n<th>CI 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>error</td>\n<td>必须修复，阻断 CI</td>\n<td>真正的 bug、安全问题</td>\n<td>构建失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>warn</td>\n<td>应当修复，不阻断</td>\n<td>最佳实践、代码风格改进</td>\n<td>构建通过，但有警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>off</td>\n<td>不检查</td>\n<td>与 Prettier 冲突的格式规则</td>\n<td>不检查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见的反模式是将所有规则都设为 <code>error</code>。这会导致开发者在早期原型阶段被大量不相关的错误阻断，最终选择注释掉 ESLint 或忽略所有警告。推荐的做法是：<strong>只有可能引起运行时错误的规则才设为 error</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import eslint from &#39;@eslint/js&#39;;&#10;import tseslint from &#39;typescript-eslint&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default tseslint.config(eslint.configs.recommended, ...tseslint.configs.recommended, {&#10;  rules: {&#10;    &#39;no-unused-vars&#39;: &#39;off&#39;,&#10;    &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars&#39;: [&#10;      &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      {&#10;        argsIgnorePattern: &#39;^_&#39;,&#10;        varsIgnorePattern: &#39;^_&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;    &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any&#39;: &#39;warn&#39;,&#10;    &#39;@typescript-eslint/consistent-type-imports&#39;: [&#10;      &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      {&#10;        prefer: &#39;type-imports&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript-eslint'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tseslint.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(eslint.configs.recommended, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tseslint.configs.recommended, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rules: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'no-unused-vars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'off'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        argsIgnorePattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^_'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        varsIgnorePattern: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^_'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '@typescript-eslint/consistent-type-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prefer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'type-imports'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"插件选型与组合\">插件选型与组合</h2><p>ESLint 生态中有数百个插件，选择合适的插件组合是配置设计的关键决策。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const pluginCategories = {&#10;  typeScript: {&#10;    name: &#39;typescript-eslint&#39;,&#10;    required: true,&#10;    configs: [&#39;recommended&#39;, &#39;recommended-type-checked&#39;, &#39;strict&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  react: {&#10;    name: &#39;eslint-plugin-react + eslint-plugin-react-hooks&#39;,&#10;    when: &#39;React 项目&#39;,&#10;    keyRules: [&#39;react/jsx-no-target-blank&#39;, &#39;react-hooks/rules-of-hooks&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  imports: {&#10;    name: &#39;eslint-plugin-import-x&#39;,&#10;    when: &#39;需要导入规范&#39;,&#10;    keyRules: [&#39;import-x/order&#39;, &#39;import-x/no-cycle&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  testing: {&#10;    name: &#39;eslint-plugin-vitest / eslint-plugin-jest&#39;,&#10;    when: &#39;测试文件&#39;,&#10;    keyRules: [&#39;vitest/expect-expect&#39;, &#39;vitest/no-identical-title&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  accessibility: {&#10;    name: &#39;eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y&#39;,&#10;    when: &#39;Web 应用&#39;,&#10;    keyRules: [&#39;jsx-a11y/alt-text&#39;, &#39;jsx-a11y/aria-props&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pluginCategories</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c